Positive Behavioral Change: Limit your fluid intake tonight to one small glass of water only when you are genuinely thirsty. By stopping the excessive, fear-driven water consumption, your bladder will settle, your sleep will be uninterrupted, and your anxiety will decrease.
Home-Based Services (Optional): None indicated.
DME/Safety (Optional): None indicated.
Follow-up: Routine GP appointment in 3-5 days to review HbA1c and oral medication efficacy.

